    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dowling Property Baldoyle, is delighted to present to the market, No. 42 Grange Road. This striking, 3 bedroom, detached home enjoys a commanding position in this highly sought after location with all amenities literally on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nThis fantastic house extends to c.100 sq.mt. and features an impressive feature list which consists of 2 reception rooms, guest w.c, upgraded gas heating, utility and 3 generous sized bedrooms. There are 2 reception rooms that link in together and could be easily opened up to make for large open plan living.\r\n\r\nThe front driveway has off-street parking for a number of cars and the rear garden is private and not overlooked and extra space is available to enlarge into the side storage space area. The location is unbeatable with Racecourse Shopping Centre just c.100 meters from your door and a c.10 minute walk will find you at Bayside Dart Station. This fine home is \"chain-free and ready-to-go\" and we are predicting strong interest, so early viewing is now advised. One Not To Be Missed!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation which is bright and spacious, consists of entrance hallway, cloakroom, guest w.c, sitting room, lounge, dining room and kitchen. Upstairs are 3 generous sized bedrooms  (2 double & 1 single) and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAll amenities are literally on your doorstep with Racecourse Shopping Centre just c.100 meters away, also you will find a selection of both primary and secondary schools, childcare, pharmacy and coffee/restaurant shop, etc. Baldoyle also boasts the brand new & state of the art Stapolin Educate Together National School. There is a vast array of leisure activities and all just a short distance to the seafront."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.98m x 0.89m \r\nSpacious hallway with new flooring. Alarm point.\r\n\r\nCloakroom - 1.3m x 0.72m \r\nStore room that has plumbing for a guest w.c. and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C. - 1.53m x 0.86m \r\nW.C, wash hand basin and chrome towel rail.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.09m x 3.08m \r\nThis extremely bright room enjoys a pleasant aspect and is light filled through large window. Wooden floor. Access to chimney for wood burning stove etc.\r\n\r\nLounge - 7.53m x 2.71m \r\nThis large reception room is extremely bright with sliding doors to decking. Wooden floor. A versatile room that could easily be remodeled to extend the kitchen if so needed by the new owner. It could also be easily integrated to the front sitting room to make open plan living if so desired. \r\n\r\nDining Area - 2.65m x 2.21m \r\nBreakfast bar area with stools. An easy space to interconnect with kitchen.\r\n\r\nKitchen - 2.77m x 2.35m \r\nExtensive range of fitted units and counter space. Beko gas hob cooker, Beko fridge. Stainless steel back splash.\r\n\r\nUtility - 2.37m x 0.66m \r\nLogik dryer and Logik washing machine. Door to outside.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing - 3.03m x 2.03m \r\nBright landing with gable window, hot-press and attic access.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.01m x 1.64m \r\nBath with Triton electric shower, w.c, wash hand basin and tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBed 1 (Rear) - 3.82m x 2.87m \r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes and wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBed 2 (Front) - 3.93m x 2.59m \r\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes and wooden floor.\r\n\r\nBed 3 (Front) - 2.33m x 2.35m \r\nSingle bedroom with built-in wardrobes and new carpet floor.\r\n\r\nOutside Front - 11.0m x 5.38m \r\nFantastic space to the front extending to c.11 meters with off-street parking for a number of cars. Fully walled. 2 gated side areas.\r\n\r\nRear - 8.12m x 8.44m \r\nA low maintenance rear garden which is fully layered with Astro Turf. Decking area. Steel shed. Outside sockets.\r\n\r\nSide Passage Storage - 5.17m x 6.46m \r\nThis storage area would be easily integrated to the rear and side garden to extend garden space if needed.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Highly Sought After Area\r\nDetached\r\n3 Generous Sized Bedrooms\r\nAccommodation Extends c.100 sq.mt.\r\nOff-Street Parking For A Number Of Cars\r\nc.100 Meters Away From Shops\r\n2 Reception Rooms\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nUtility Room\r\nUpgraded Gas Heating System\r\nDouble Glazed P.V.C. Windows\r\nc.100 Meters To Seagrange Park\r\nChain Free & Ready To Go\r\nShort Walk To Bayside Dart Station"
      },
